Calculating the differences: x2 - x1 is 10 - 2 = 8. And y2 - y1 is 5 - 5 = 0. So the distance between A and B is sqrt[(8)² + (0)²] = sqrt[64 + 0] = sqrt[64] = 8. So the diameter is 8 units long. 

